# Saqf Project Memory

## Project
- **Name:** Saqf / سقف (Saqf Property Collective)
- **Type:** Frontend-only one-page landing page (no backend)
- **Stack:** Vite + React + TypeScript
- **Languages:** English (LTR) + Arabic (RTL), toggle in nav; preference in `localStorage` (`saqf-lang`)

## Brand
- **Colors:** `#202350` (navy), `#dbb382` (gold), `#fffeff` (off-white)
- **Logo:** `public/images/saqf-logo.png` (original); header uses `public/images/saqf-logo-transparent.png`; favicon `public/images/favicon.png` (transparent, cropped)
- **Header:** `position: fixed` sticky; gains navy glass background after scroll (`.is-scrolled`)
- **Fonts:** Cormorant Garamond (serif headings), Manrope (sans body/nav)

## Design (match attached mockup)
1. Sticky nav: logo | Home · The Factory · Specifications · Investment · Contact | Get in Touch (WhatsApp) + EN/AR; Contact → `#cta`
2. Hero: full-bleed **background video** + dark gradient overlay, left-aligned headline/sub/CTA
3. Cards overlap hero (no white gap): `--hero-overlap` + side/mid pop; navy band height `--band-h`; About image `public/images/about-building.jpg`; expertise cross dividers
4. Company Overview (white): USP list (gold index + title + body) left, office image right — not numeric stats
5. CTA band after overview (navy): title, body, WhatsApp button only — EN/AR in `translations.cta`
6. Dark footer with logo, contact, copyright

## File map
- `src/App.tsx` — page composition
- `src/components/{Header,Hero,FeatureCards,CompanyOverview,Footer,SpecBody,icons}.tsx`
- Hero CTA opens WhatsApp for `footer.phone` (`+962796547704`)
- Specs card: title “Specifications” / “المواصفات”; `SpecBody` turns `\n` lines into bullets
- `src/context/LanguageContext.tsx` — lang + `dir` on `<html>`
- `src/i18n/translations.ts` — EN/AR copy
- `src/index.css` — all layout/visual styles
- `public/images/saqf-logo.png` — brand logo

## Constraints
- Keep design identical to mockup; hero uses video instead of still image
- No backend; static assets / CDN media only
- **Update this memory file on every meaningful change**

